00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:06.150 align:start position:0%
 
pick one word  if you want to make better business  decisions if you want to bring on better  employees if you want your customers to  spread the word about you  then pick one word that defines the  values that your business stands for  so it's easy for everybody to understand  what it is that you do and spread the  message  otherwise people will be confused and it  makes decision making hard and makes  bringing on new employees hard it makes  it hard for your customers  to talk about you  which is so important when you're first  starting up a business  i got a great question from one of my  youtube viewers khaled and i guess i had  mentioned this in one of my videos and  he wrote in great video my business  helps unleash the hidden potential  within kids i have a passion for this i  provide kids with something that's not  taught in our schools how can you put  this into one word  finding your one word is really tough  and really at the end of the day only  you can do it because it's got to be  something that you passionately believe  in you should read that word and it  should start making your heart jump it  should start getting you excited  so maybe it's something around kids  maybe it's about passion maybe it's  about potential maybe it's about  unleashing maybe it's about something  hidden or it was a totally different  word  you've already done a great job and turn  it into one sentence  now i try to combine that  and condense it even further down  but only you can really come up with  that word  and maybe would help us is to share how  i  come up with mind so my word is belief  and it took a long time  to get to that word of belief and i've  been in business for a number of years  and it's always been i've always  believed in entrepreneurs i've always  helped entrepreneurs and i haven't  changed  but the type of company that i've built  has changed and the way people talk  about me has changed and it's much more  in line with what i do  because i made it easy for them  to spread the message  so  i believe in entrepreneurs  if i'm bringing on somebody new to my  team you better believe in entrepreneurs  i don't care if you're the most gifted  programmer graphic designer copywriter  whatever it is if you're coming on board  you have to believe in entrepreneurs  otherwise you're out  if i want my customers to talk about me  they are because they believe in what  i'm doing  if i'm creating new products or creating  new content  then it has to help entrepreneurs  believe in themselves more or help their  customers believe in them more  it makes decision making  so much easier and helps people spread  the message about you so much faster  when you have one word that stands for  something that can create a movement and  get people excited  how i actually went about finding my  word was i started  i started thinking about all the  different things that that i did believe  in the things that  made me different the things that i felt  were core to me  and you want to think about things that  are totally outside of business  this is what you stand for as a person  because no matter what business you  start  you're still going to bring these core  values with you  so for me i wrote down things like  helpful  and helping i like i like helping people  i happen to apply that to entrepreneurs  but i love helping people in any  business i start  would would involve helping people  because that's what i'm all about  believe just seemed to resonate with me  more  and so i ran with that and all the  content that i provide i try to make  sure it's uplifting right it's still  it's still truthful it can still be raw  it can still hurt  but it's meant to build you up it's  meant to make you believe in yourself  and to believe that what you're doing is  possible and believe that that you're  doing the right thing  and so that word means something to me  and it means something to the people who  join my team and it means something to  the people who interact and watch these  videos and chime in on the website and  tweet me up on online and  i'm creating a group of people who share  the same value system as i do  and so you want the same thing for your  business and i can't tell you what that  word is i can only encourage you to  follow the same exercise i did  of writing different thoughts and  different words down on paper  until you find the one  that really hits you and when i first  saw believe i really liked it  i thought i would go with it but i said  you know what i'm gonna i'm gonna take  the night i'm gonna sleep on it and i  looked at the list again the next day  and i still loved it  and then from that day forth everything  had to change in my business everything  became about belief  and it's become much more powerful as a  result  so when you're creating your one word  remember that it's not related to your  business  it's something that is core to you  that you will take  in any circumstance that you go to in  any business that you start in any job  that you would take  you're bringing that core value and you  want to see it in every customer and  every employee that works with your  business when you can do that  it makes it so much easier to make good  decisions to bring on the right people  to bring on the right customers and for  customers to spread the word about your  business  believe  for those of you watching you liked the  video please give it a thumbs up i'd  also love to hear what you have to think  if you want to leave a comment under the  video i really appreciate seeing those  come in they really do make my day every  day when i check them so thank you and  i'll see you on the next episode

